ween computation and  communication so you can think of  neurons performing computation  and the inter  networking the interconnectivity of  neurons is communication routine neurons  and you see this with very large server  systems i've been i mentioned offline  been talking to jim keller whose dreams  to build giant computers that  uh you know  the bottom like there's often the  communication between the different  pieces of computing  you
 

